  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen updating an Avatar, your Quick Menu Avatar Details will show the latest and correct information. When opening the Avatar Details of the same Avatar in the Main Menu though, the information displayed will be outdated.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**  \n\n1. Switch to an uploaded Avatar\n\n2. Update the Avatar you are now in (change something that would show up in the performance ranking)  \n\n3. Switch to a different Avatar\n\n4. Switch back to the just updated Avatar\n\n5. Compare the Quick Menu and Main Menu Avatar Details\n\nIf you do this you will notice that the Details in the Main Menu will be out of date.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nBoth the Quick and Main Menu should show the same and also correct information.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: https://files.catbox.moe/ni6eft.mp4",
